      "mentions": 51,
      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive clinicians and dedicated support staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners on Roncesvalles Avenue praise Dr. Jordy and the clinical team for their compassionate, thorough care and warm bedside manner. Clients appreciate that veterinary technicians handle nervous pets gently and take time to address questions thoroughly. While two reviewers noted frustration with staff turnover or scheduling, the broad consensus remains overwhelmingly positive."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 20,
      "title": {
        "en": "Stress-free handling for cats and dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers repeatedly note how comfortable their dogs and cats feel when arriving at Roncy Village Veterinary Clinic. Clients with sensitive or cautious felines praise the gentle handling during routine examinations, blood draws, and vaccinations. Patrons value that the clinic uses positive reassurance and treats to keep pets relaxed throughout checkups."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear consultations with follow-up calls"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents highlight the clinic's transparent communication regarding medical conditions, diagnostic findings, and ongoing treatment plans. Many clients appreciate post-visit check-in calls from technicians to monitor recovery at home. Although two reviewers cited communication delays or unexpected charges, most clients report honest guidance without high-pressure sales."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
